    "detailed_description": "The Story starts after a covid outbreak where a new strain of the virus causes people to turn into the undead.<br />\r\nOnly a few people have survived and are trying to Sustain a place to stay and survive the winter and cold nights with zombies and Robots taking over what use to belong to them. Stranded on a island trying to survive looking for food, water and medical. <br />\r\nMake sure to follow your objectives and get yourself a place to stay ASAP so that you can survive the cold Dark nights.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThere will be updates every week with new content and bug fixes <br />\r\n<br />\r\nSustained will be in early access for 3 - 4 years as I am a solo Developer trying my best to give you the best experience in the game that I can offer. I do have a few social media links where you can come to give me feedback to improve the game where I can.<br />\r\nSo have fun and learn to know your character's abilities as it might give you that win streak.",
    "about_the_game": "The Story starts after a covid outbreak where a new strain of the virus causes people to turn into the undead.<br />\r\nOnly a few people have survived and are trying to Sustain a place to stay and survive the winter and cold nights with zombies and Robots taking over what use to belong to them. Stranded on a island trying to survive looking for food, water and medical. <br />\r\nMake sure to follow your objectives and get yourself a place to stay ASAP so that you can survive the cold Dark nights.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThere will be updates every week with new content and bug fixes <br />\r\n<br />\r\nSustained will be in early access for 3 - 4 years as I am a solo Developer trying my best to give you the best experience in the game that I can offer. I do have a few social media links where you can come to give me feedback to improve the game where I can.<br />\r\nSo have fun and learn to know your character's abilities as it might give you that win streak.",
    "short_description": "This is a open world Survival Zombie game with survival mechanics in single player and (PVP) (PVE) in Multiplayer or Co-Op. Join a few friends and look who can survive the island full of zombies and other players trying to survive like you, it has base building, Crafting, food, water, Temperatures.",
